Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的还没准备好 要当父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you're gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:47.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're one of the most caring, responsible men in North America.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:47.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是整个北美洲最细心 最有责任感的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna make a great dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会是好爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, Ross. You and the baby just need better blocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，罗斯，你和宝宝只需要 有个好的阻档
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:02.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Have either of you ever been to the Rainbow Room? Is it expensive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:02.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人到过彩虹屋吗  很贵吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:04.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Only if you order stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:04.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有叫餐的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm taking Ursula tonight. It's her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今晚要带乌苏拉去 今天她生日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:11.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Whoa. What about Phoebe's birthday? - When's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:11.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那菲比生日怎么办  - 她什么时候生日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:14.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:14.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh, man, what are the odds of that happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:18.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么这么巧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你慢慢想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:28.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:28.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:33.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:33.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么打算
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:38.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What can I do? I don't want to screw it up with Ursula.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:38.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能怎么办  我不想搞砸和乌苏拉这边的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And your friend Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你的朋友菲比就可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:43.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she's my friend, hopefully she'll understand. Wouldn't you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:43.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是真的朋友就能谅解啊 你们不就会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Man, if you tried that on my birthday...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄，要是我生日 你给我搞这套
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:49.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you'd be staring at the business end of a hissy fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:49.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你准备看我发飙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You add a pinch of saffron, it makes all the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}加一小撮番红花 会起很大作用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.53,0:05:00.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.53,0:05:00.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.78,0:05:02.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Monica? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.78,0:05:02.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 摩妮卡 - 是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对，是她 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. This is my friend Rachel. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我朋友瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:09.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, uh, Rachel, I'm Dr. Mitchell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:09.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋 我是米契尔大夫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm his friend Dr. Rosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是他朋友罗森大夫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:15.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aren't you a little cute to be a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:15.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这样当大夫 会不会太可爱了点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:16.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:16.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, young, young. I meant young, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:20.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Young to be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:20.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当大夫年轻了点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:23.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, good, Rach. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:23.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 说的好，瑞秋 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:24.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:24.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.65,0:05:35.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So he said it was just a sprain, and that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.65,0:05:35.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是扭到 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, you left out the stupid part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}糗事你没说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:40.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:40.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不糗啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:44.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The very cute doctors asked us out for tomorrow night, and I said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:44.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这两位师医生明晚要 跟我们约会，我答应了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.95,0:05:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it's totally insane. I mean, they work for the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.95,0:05:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太疯狂了 他们可是在那家医院上班
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:51.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like returning to the scene of the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:51.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这简直就像回到 犯罪现场一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I say we blow off the dates. - What? Monica, they are cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们别去约会了 - 啥 摩妮卡 他们又帅
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:59.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They are doctors. Cute doctors. Doctors who are cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又是医生，帅医生 是医生又很帅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, what have we learned so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，到目前 我们知道什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:13.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:13.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:23.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell are you doing? You scared the crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:23.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们搞什么啦  吓死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:27.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Was that the cake? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:27.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那是蛋糕吗  - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.99,0:06:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got a lemon shmush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.99,0:06:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我买了个柠檬蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:32.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. She'll be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:32.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样 她．马上就到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:34.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: I hope it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:34.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但愿没砸烂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:41.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Happy Birthday, Peehee."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:41.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝生日快乐，灰椅〞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:45.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we can make a B out of one of those roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:45.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许可以用玫瑰 写成B字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:48.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, we'll just use our special cake tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:48.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就用特制蛋糕工具
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:50.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, what's going on? CHANDLER: Oh, we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:50.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么了  - 我们只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，哦，哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:57.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:57.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:06:59.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:06:59.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:01.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This was not at all scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:01.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一点也不吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:03.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, everybody. Hi, Betty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:03.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位，蓓蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:04.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Betty, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蓓蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:08.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You found Betty. Oh, my gosh. This is so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:08.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们找来蓓蒂 天啊，好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.37,0:07:11.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everybody I love is in the same room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.37,0:07:11.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢的人都聚在一堂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where's Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you see Betty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到蓓蒂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:32.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I tell you, I wouldn't mind having a piece of this sun-dried-tomato business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:32.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟你说吧 我不介意投资 生产蕃茄干产业
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:37.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Five years ago, if somebody'd said to me, "Here's a tomato that looks like a prune"...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:37.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五年前要是有人跟我说 我们可以让蕃茄变枣干
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:39.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'd have said, "Get out of my office."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:39.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会说 给我滚出去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:46.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dad, before I was born, did you freak out at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:46.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸，我出生前 你有很紧张吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:48.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not freaking out. I'm just saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:48.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没紧张 我只是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:50.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if someone had come to me with the idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:50.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是有人来跟我说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:54.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dad, Dad, Dad. I'm talking about the whole, uh, baby thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:54.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸，我是在说 生小孩的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:57.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you, uh, ever get this sort of...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:57.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有过那种
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:08:02.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...panicky, "Oh, my God, I'm gonna be a father" kind of a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:08:02.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为人父恐慌症吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:07.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your mother really did the work. I was busy with the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:07.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你妈很尽责 我全心冲事业
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:09.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wasn't around that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:09.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不常在家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:12.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:12.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你讲半天是要讲这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.35,0:08:14.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, Dad. I was just wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.35,0:08:14.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是啦，爸 我只是在想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:17.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's time to make up for that. We can do stuff together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:17.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还来得及弥补 我可以陪你做些事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You always wanted to go to colonial Williamsburg. How about we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:22.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一直说想去威廉斯堡 就去那好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:24.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks, Dad. Really, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:24.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了，爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:27.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I just, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:27.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just needed to know, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是想弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.91,0:08:33.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when did you start to feel like a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.91,0:08:33.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是何时才觉得 自己已经当爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:40.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Well, I guess it must have been the day after you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:40.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好像是你出生第二天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were in the hospital room, your mother was asleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和你妈在病房 你妈在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:48.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and they brought you in and gave you to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:48.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们带你进房 让我抱着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:50.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were this ugly little red thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:50.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是个长得红红丑丑的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:56.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And all of a sudden, you grabbed my finger with your whole fist...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:56.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}突然间，你用手掐了我手指一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:57.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you squeezed it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:57.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}紧紧抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:08:59.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:08:59.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抓得好牢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's when I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那时我才醒悟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:09.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you don't want to go to Williamsburg?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:09.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你不想去威廉斯堡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can go to Williamsburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eat your fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吃鱼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Rachel, the cute doctors are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋 帅医生来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: Okay, coming.
