Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:30.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, here, we brought wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们带了酒来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:36.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at this. It's from the cellars of Ernest and Tova Borgnine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:36.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是波格奈酒庄的名酒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.43,0:09:39.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So how could we resist? - Oh, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.43,0:09:39.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么能不喝 - 好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:41.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So, Monica, how's the ankle? - It's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:41.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 摩妮卡 脚踝好吗  - 就…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:45.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:45.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你自己讲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After all, it is your ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毕竟脚踝长在你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it's feeling a lot better. Thank you.
