Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, why don't you guys sit down, and we'll get you some glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请坐 我们拿杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:59.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Um... - Stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:05.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, listen, I'm thinking, why don't we just tell them who we really are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:05.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干脆把身份说清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:09.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I mean, I think it'll be fine. - It will not. We'll get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:09.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不会有事的 - 不可能，会惹祸上身
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, would you stop being such a wuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡 别这么没用好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:15.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A wuss? Excuse me for living in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:15.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没用 我头脑清楚 有错吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:18.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So? - So they still seem normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:18.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 所以呢  - 她们还是很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's because they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她们本来就很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to admit, when we go out with women we meet at the hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}承认吧 每次跟医院病人约会都…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you relax? Take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别穷紧张  你看看身边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.44,0:10:28.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are no pagan altars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.44,0:10:28.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有异教徒的圣坛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:32.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No piles of bones in the corners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:32.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}角落没堆人骨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:34.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're fine. Go like this:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:34.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们没问题 跟我这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:42.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I said we are not going to do it, okay? Sometimes you can be such a big baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:42.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能那样好吗  你有时候真的太天真
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.75,0:10:44.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I am not a baby. - Be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.75,0:10:44.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我才不天真 - 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:46.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You get uptight... - You act like a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:46.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是你穷紧张 - 你有公主病
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:49.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You know what? You know what? - What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:49.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你知道怎样吗  - 怎样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:53.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every day you are becoming more and more like your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:53.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你越来越像你妈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:56.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me. Hello, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:56.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}借过 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a great place. How long have you lived here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这地方很棒 你们住多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:03.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks. I've been here about six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:03.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢，差不多六年
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:07.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And Rachel moved in a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:07.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋前几个月才搬来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:10.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, I was supposed to get married...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:10.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本来要嫁人了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.07,0:11:13.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but, um, I left the guy at the altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.07,0:11:13.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但临到圣坛才甩了人家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really? - Yeah.
