Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:21.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I know it's pretty selfish, but, heh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:21.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是有点自私啦 不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...hey, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是这样啊
