Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:37.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好厉害 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:43.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mostly because I get to boss people around, which I just love to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:43.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我可以对人颐指气使 正好是我的嗜好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, this hummus is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沙拉酱好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:50.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God bless the chickpea.
