Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:56.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:56.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
