Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，是我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, Dad, I can't talk right now. Um...
