Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:57.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Urs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:57.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乌苏拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:18:59.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing here? I've been trying to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:18:59.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你来干嘛 我一直打给你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.08,0:19:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.08,0:19:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't say "listen." I know that "listen." I've said that "listen."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别说这个 我认得这口气，我常用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:08.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:08.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:11.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't get it. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:11.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不懂  怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:14.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about everything you said under the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:14.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在桥下说的话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:17.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, um, ahem...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:17.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:20.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, just forget about what I said under the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:20.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}忘了我在桥下说的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:24.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was talking crazy that night. I was so drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:24.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我醉了 讲都是傻话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:27.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:27.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不喝酒的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:29.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:29.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错，我不喝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:32.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I was drunk on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:32.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我因为你而醉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:36.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, Urs. - But, yeah, so it's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:36.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 乌苏拉 - 但我们不可能有进展的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:39.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? Is it because I'm friends with Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:39.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么  是因为我是菲比的朋友
