Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:43.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是这个原因  你会愿意跟她绝交吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:46.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:46.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:48.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I couldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:48.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行，我办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:52.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, then, yeah, it's because of Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:52.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么，就是因为菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:56.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you know, it's either her or me.
