Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:01.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then, uh... Then I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:01.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那，真的抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:07.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know...
