Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.61,0:20:11.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.61,0:20:11.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:22.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know whether it's just because we're breaking up or what...
